  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><ul><li>Site Location and Block Plan (drawing no.: 24/046/001, dated: 07/03/2025)</li><li>Proposed Plans and Elevations (drawing no.: 24/046/003, dated: 07/03/2025)</li><li>Design and Access Statement (dated: April 2025)</li></ul><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "Prior to occupation, full details of the security measures shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&nbsp; The proposed development shall achieve security standards in accordance with Secured by Design principles, to the satisfaction of the Metropolitan Police.&nbsp;All approved security measures shall be permanently retained thereafter."
